# Ignore Vivado simulation files and directories
**/sim_*/          # Any folder starting with sim_
**/*.wdb           # Vivado waveform database files
**/*.sim           # Vivado simulation files
**/xsim/           # Vivado simulation directory
**/*.vcd           # Value change dump files
**/*.bit           # Bitstream files
**/*.ltx           # Vivado log files
**/*.log           # Simulation log files
**/*.jou           # Vivado journal files
**/*.bak           # Backup files
